ue of a negative result was 95   in this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  added by  frederick carl koerner  m d  signed on  22 removed_month 96 at 16 58 gross description  received fresh in the frozen section lab   labeled remove_patient_name  patient s name and unit number  is a removed_date x removed_date x 0 9cm soft pink tan piece of tissue  it is inked and breadloafed to reveal rubbery white tissue with focal grittiness  the entire specimen is submitted in cassettes a through d  cassette a contains a possible calcification  cassette b contains a possible fibrous lesion  resident  rhonda yantiss  md     intra operative diagnosis     gross diagnosis  right breast  biopsy  no lesion suspicious for invasive tumor is identified  o r  resident  alexander kratz  md o r  diagnosis by  john h  eichhorn  m d                                                                                  source care unit  same day surgical unit    removed_accession_id  reports to  david william rattner  m d  part   right breast biopsy   report_end  , Absent.
